      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "With irrigation from the canal, Grand Terrace blossomed into a citrus hub, later replacing lost groves with hardy walnuts and peaches.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Terrace%2C_California",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Grand Terrace sits between Blue Mountain to the east and the La Loma Hills to the west, giving it a unique valley setting.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
